{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c100a3e6-a754-8686-a013-f3da65e9aef7",
  "created_at": "2026-02-26T13:15:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dominic Mancini",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:14:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:14:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello Kevin. Dominic Mancini calling, I'm at 460 Farewell Street, up the North End. Got a mess out front of my house, and it's not from any storm, mind you. It's been dry for days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:14:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, what's going on out there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:14:43-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plow left a snowbank right on top of the catch basin, and now the water's got nowhere to go. It's pooling clear across the lane. Every time it thaws a little, same thing again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:14:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "How deep are we talking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:14:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, about up to the hubcaps on my car. I can't get out of the driveway without a swim."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:15:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wow, okay. Blocked basin, 460 Farewell, water across the road. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:15:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So who do I call to get it checked? Is that you folks, or somebody else? Because I'm sick of this, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:15:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's us. I'll put in a request for a crew to clear it. Is it just your side of the street, or all over Aquidneck, I mean, all through the neighborhood?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:15:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Aqua what? Sorry, I thought you said something else there. Aquidneck, right, the island. Apologies, Kevin. No, just our block."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-26T13:15:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I've got it down. A crew will look at it."
    }
  ],
